    {
      "type": "Feature",
      "properties": {
        "kind": "polygon",
        "name": "Omoide Yokocho",
        "color": "#e63946",
        "blurb": "\"Memory Lane\" — yakitori and beer under the tracks.",
        "notes": "A narrow strip of alleys wedged against the rail tracks just west of Shinjuku Station, split into Shinjukugado-W and -E. Smoky, cramped, lantern-lit counters serving yakitori and cheap beer since the postwar black-market days. A few minutes' walk from Kabukicho and Golden Gai."
      },
