        "blurb": "Nightlife strip by day, major art museums by daylight.",
        "notes": "Roppongi Hills and Tokyo Midtown anchor the art-museum side (Mori Art Museum, National Art Center nearby); after dark the streets toward Roppongi Crossing turn into one of Tokyo's busiest bar/club areas, popular with tourists and expats."
